sequenceDiagram
    actor Approver
    participant UI as Web UI<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/wwwroot/app.js
    participant Auth as SessionAuthMiddleware<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Auth/SessionAuthMiddleware.cs
    participant Role as RequireRoleAttribute<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Auth/RequireRoleAttribute.cs
    participant Controller as ApprovalsController<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Controllers/ApprovalsController.cs
    participant Service as ApprovalService<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/ApprovalService.cs
    participant Repo as IInvoiceRepository<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/IInvoiceRepository.cs
    participant Store as InMemoryInvoiceRepository<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/InMemoryInvoiceRepository.cs

    Approver->>UI: Click approve on pending invoice
    UI->>Auth: POST /api/approvals/{invoiceId}/approve with bearer token
    Auth->>Auth: Require valid session for /api except login
    Auth->>Role: Continue to controller filters
    Role->>Role: Require role Approver or Admin
    Role->>Controller: Invoke Approve(invoiceId)
    Controller->>Service: Approve(invoiceId, session.Username)
    Service->>Repo: GetById(invoiceId)
    Repo->>Store: Read in-memory invoice
    Store-->>Repo: Invoice or null
    Repo-->>Service: Invoice
    Service->>Service: Ensure status is PendingApproval
    Service->>Service: Set Approved, DecidedBy, DecidedAt
    Service->>Repo: Update(invoice)
    Repo->>Store: Replace in-memory invoice
    Service-->>Controller: Approved invoice
    Controller-->>UI: 200 OK with invoice response
    UI-->>Approver: Show approved state

    alt Missing invoice
        Service-->>Controller: KeyNotFoundException
        Controller-->>UI: 404 via ApiControllerBase.Handle
    else Not pending
        Service-->>Controller: InvalidOperationException
        Controller-->>UI: 409 via ApiControllerBase.Handle
    else Invalid or missing session
        Auth-->>UI: 401
    else Missing role
        Role-->>UI: 403
    end
